===Noun===
[[Image:Brass_thumbtack.jpg|thumb|right|160px|A brass thumbtack]]
{{en-noun|head=[[thumb]][[tack]]}}

# A small nail-like [[tack]] with a slightly [[rounded]] [[head]] that can be [[pressed]] into place with light [[pressure]] from the [[thumb]]; used for hanging light [[article]]s on a [[wall]] or [[noticeboard]]

====Synonyms====
* [[drawing pin]] {{qualifier|British}}
* [[pushpin]]

